      "description": "<p>When you deal damage to one or more creatures while you bear the <strong>Symbol of Elements</strong>, if the symbolist can see you, they may spend an amount of MP equal to <strong>one third of the total damage being inflicted to those creatures</strong> (including any sources of extra damage). If you do, all damage dealt this way becomes <strong>fire</strong> damage.</p>",
